{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Hey Dave! Long time no talk! I had a great time yesterday, and visited some sights in Boston with a high school friend. It was really fun and eye-opening."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_26-25ae97cf3f5fbe9cfb5f40e3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:08:55.989082+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "25ae97cf3f5fbe9cfb5f40e3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "25ae97cf3f5fbe9cfb5f40e3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Hey Calvin! Good to hear from you! Sounds like you had a blast in Boston - so much to do there! One of my favorites there is great for chilling and admiring nature. BTW, something cool I wanted to tell you about - I recently attended a conference in Detroit - it was so cool, I learned a lot."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_26-29ad1fd4af8d5e1a185804d4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:08:56.010461+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "29ad1fd4af8d5e1a185804d4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "29ad1fd4af8d5e1a185804d4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: I had a wonderful experience during my time in Boston. It had awesome architecture and a really cool history. I followed your advice and went there, it was so peaceful. Good to hear that you've learned a lot of new things at the conference in Detroit!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_26-17504fec140df55ca447a4e6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:08:56.030081+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "17504fec140df55ca447a4e6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "17504fec140df55ca447a4e6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Glad you enjoyed Boston! It's got some great architecture and history. Working on this takes me out of my head and calms me down. Here's a pic of my latest car project."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_26-6ccccb1ebf5a77ccb5b7ca19", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:08:56.046086+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6ccccb1ebf5a77ccb5b7ca19", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6ccccb1ebf5a77ccb5b7ca19", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Dave, that car looks awesome! What got you into engineering cars? I'm totally into cars too and love making new and powerful models."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_26-a6ce4fc15a13c0062c0f2b1b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:08:56.055385+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a6ce4fc15a13c0062c0f2b1b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a6ce4fc15a13c0062c0f2b1b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Thanks, Calvin! It's always been my thing. My dad took me to my first car show when I was 10, and I was wow-ed! I was hooked and wanted to learn more. Now I'm an automotive engineer and it's crazy to think that something so powerful and cool can be made from small parts."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_26-e12abc24e5ea70db67b621b2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:08:56.074108+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e12abc24e5ea70db67b621b2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e12abc24e5ea70db67b621b2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: That's awesome, Dave! So happy you followed your dreams and became an engineer. Seeing you work on cars is inspiring - it makes me want to keep pushing my music. Check this out - a pic of me performing with someone I admire! So amazing!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_26-0c950faf2b6a71c852e67721", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:08:56.090879+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0c950faf2b6a71c852e67721", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0c950faf2b6a71c852e67721", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Wow, Calvin! That's amazing! You looked super comfortable on stage. Bet it was an incredible experience to perform with someone you admire. How did it feel being up there?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_26-8a7babcd60578375c813cd24", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:08:56.107993+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8a7babcd60578375c813cd24", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8a7babcd60578375c813cd24", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: It was unreal, Dave. Being up there with someone I admire - it was a dream come true. The energy, the crowd - it made me realize how much music means to me, it's like my passion and my purpose."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_26-9480d55cddd3634280ba2e08", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:08:56.124078+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9480d55cddd3634280ba2e08", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9480d55cddd3634280ba2e08", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: That's great, Calvin. We both have discovered something that brings us fulfillment. It's a fortunate thing for us."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_26-bb40b6660d8f40514cc87b08", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:08:56.141691+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "bb40b6660d8f40514cc87b08", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "bb40b6660d8f40514cc87b08", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Definitely, Dave. It's awesome to find something that makes us happy. It's fulfilling and motivating too. I'm so glad we're on this journey together and curious to see what happens next!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_26-83775f527fabfb5c745e7190", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:08:56.155980+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "83775f527fabfb5c745e7190", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "83775f527fabfb5c745e7190", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Me too, Calvin! Let's see where it takes us. We can keep inspiring each other!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_26-08a5b14fb5acdfd74b2316e4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:08:56.171953+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "08a5b14fb5acdfd74b2316e4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "08a5b14fb5acdfd74b2316e4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Yep, let's keep inspiring each other to be our best selves. Keep going for your passion, buddy."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_26-2f4172ed19ec459c9a9a998f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:08:56.190251+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2f4172ed19ec459c9a9a998f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2f4172ed19ec459c9a9a998f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Thanks, Calvin! Same to you! Keep pursuing your passion and keep dreaming. We got this! Got to go see you soon!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_26-654bebe7af4c8b3a4151e0a8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:08:56.205515+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "654bebe7af4c8b3a4151e0a8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "654bebe7af4c8b3a4151e0a8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Thanks, Dave! I appreciate your support. Let's keep pushing for our goals. Catch you later, see ya!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_26-518492d663532a5f59aea616", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:08:56.218816+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "518492d663532a5f59aea616", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "518492d663532a5f59aea616", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
